      "show_progress_bar": false,
      "narration": "Now we have two pushes, one from each clue. But the model needs one answer, not two. So it puts both pushes on the same dog-or-cat scale. Zero point three five plus zero point two two gives us one internal lean: zero point five seven toward dog. This matters because the model needs one score it can turn into a final answer.",
